// Intentionally triggers a runtime division-by-zero error on the second
// call. Used by tests/integration.rs to check that the error is caught
// (not a panic) and reported with the line of the division itself, not
// the call site. This file is NOT run by the CLI/Docker demo.
fn divide(a, b) {
    return a / b;
}

print divide(10, 2);
print divide(5, 0);
